  "limitations": [
    "No real product endpoint is called before C25: AI Red Teaming, Model Security and AgentGuard are synthetic local TLS services at the production paths (tools/native-acceptance/mgmt_server.py and the integration test server). Fixture builds only; signed packages are C26.",
    "D039: only v1's live reads are reproduced; every v1 Red Teaming and Supply Chain preview or stub is disclosed as not available with no control. ASR is never computed. Reads use the SDK's raw read on the Red Team, Model Security and AgentGuard clients at the typed operations' paths because the typed models reject totals v1 tolerated; endpoints are the SDK's defaults (api.apps.paloaltonetworks.com), qualified live in C25.",
    "Attack results are read page by page on opening up to v1's ten-page cap (v1 read two pages and offered Load more); each page is the same bounded read.",
    "The C13 workload budgets were registered in commit 531b719 before implementation (docs/planning/evidence/C13/workload-budget-registration.json) and measured on the prepared fixture bundle by tools/perf/measure_c13.py.",
    "Deferred with reasons (D039): v1's idle polling, encrypted metric history, cross-session cached snapshots and Home tiles for these products (C16-C18)."
  ],
